Subject: Reset your BEPA EIS password
Content-Type: text/html; charset=UTF-8

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<body style="margin:0;padding:32px;background:#f1f5f9;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#334155;">
<div style="max-width:560px;margin:auto;padding:32px;background:#fff;border-radius:12px;">
    <h1 style="color:#1e293b;font-size:26px;">Reset your password</h1>
    <p>We received a request to reset your BEPA EIS password.</p>
    <p>Use the link below to choose a new password. The link is valid for 24 hours and can only be used once.</p>
    <p style="margin:28px 0;"><a href="{{resetLink}}" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 22px;background:#046bd2;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;font-weight:bold;">Enter new password</a></p>
    <p>If the button does not work, copy this link into your browser:</p>
    <p style="word-break:break-all;"><a href="{{resetLink}}">{{resetLink}}</a></p>
    <p>Your password stays unchanged until you choose and save a new one.</p>
    <p>If you did not request this change, you can ignore this email.</p>
    <p style="margin-top:28px;color:#64748b;font-size:13px;">BEPA EIS</p>
</div>
</body>
</html>
